~ start
do stage_party("Julian", "base")
Julian: Yes?
=> hub

~ hub
What do you want to say to him?
- What were you talking about on the phone? 
	=> phone_talk
- Nothing. Never mind. [Leave]
	=> leave

~ phone_talk
Player: Saw you talking pretty intensely over the phone.
Player: Didn't seem like a pleasant conversation.
Julian: It wasn't.
Julian: It also doesn't concern you.
Julian: No wonder you all are scrambling over in the Genomics department.
Julian: No one there wants to work anymore.
if Flags.get_level_flag("party_companion_staged") == true:
	Layla: Well, we're at work right now!
	Julian: Are you? I thought you were just visiting.
	Layla: Umm... yes, I am doing that..
	Layla: But also...
	Julian: I'd love to know more, but I'm very busy right now.
	# then I want this to go to: Anything else you want to waste my time with ? Andd we go back to the hub.
Player: Right. Carry on, then.
=> hub

~ leave
Julian: Mm.
=> END
